### Start Personality Assessment
POST {{baseUrl}}/personality/start/a56535c3-5607-4f13-877b-49ed0f39125a
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### Determine Next Eligible Energy Center
GET {{baseUrl}}/personality/next-center/a56535c3-5607-4f13-877b-49ed0f39125a
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


